content:
On the replacement haul-away credit of a Northgate Scheduled Large-Item Delivery order under **Northgate Store and Online Orders**, the value the claim settled — the settlement amount of the customer's most recent claim settlement on the records of Northgate Protect Protection Plans (administered by Keystone Protection Services), where two share the most recent date the one recorded first — sets an extra percentage:

- 1,000.00 or more: adds 10 percent;
- 500.00 up to but not including 1,000.00: adds 5 percent;
- less than 500.00: adds nothing.

**Both sides (hypothetical amounts).** A settlement of 1,000.00 adds 10 percent and one of 999.99 adds 5 percent; one of 500.00 adds 5 percent and one of 499.99 adds nothing.
